    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=kh55jtaove]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=kh55jtaove]{color:#cccccc}[data-colorid=y7siywuzyw]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=y7siywuzyw]{color:#cccccc}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"Auto-CalculationofObservations-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni supports auto-calculation of observations in forms. One can use this feature for calculated fields like BMI (Body Mass Index).&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Refer to the screenshot below, where BMI and BMI values (Calculated Values) are shown in the Nutritional Values Display Control in the Patient Dashboard:</span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/Calculated%20Values.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448262708133&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=401\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/33456359/Calculated%20Values.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448262708133&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013212\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Calculated Values.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"33456359\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"22\" data-media-id=\"c92209ba-b4ae-4707-8746-2c3dc550f59c\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/Calculated%20Values.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448262708133&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1263&amp;height=724 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/Calculated%20Values.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448262708133&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=401 1x\" /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Patient Dashboard</strong></p><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"Auto-CalculationofObservations-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Below are mentioned the steps to be followed for <em>BMI</em> calculation. Similar steps can be used to capture any other Auto-Calculated observations.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1) Setup the BMI Data concept in OpenMRS, as a container for BMI and BMI Abnormal concepts. Refer to the screenshot below:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI%20Data.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448272053554&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=408\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/33456359/BMI%20Data.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448272053554&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013245\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"BMI Data.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"33456359\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"22\" data-media-id=\"0c5eb3da-f80d-4eb9-bb95-4e19ad822c78\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI%20Data.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448272053554&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1254&amp;height=731 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI%20Data.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448272053554&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=408 1x\" /></span><strong style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">BMI Data Setup in OpenMRS</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2) Setup BMI (For BMI Values) and BMI Status (For BMI Statuses such as Normal, Underweight, etc.) Concepts. Choose Class as &quot;Computed&quot; as these are Calculated Values. The screenshot <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">below&nbsp;</span>displays the BMI and BMI Status concepts setup in OpenMRS:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">&nbsp;</span><br /><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448268364702&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=402\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/33456359/BMI.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448268364702&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013229\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"BMI.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"33456359\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"22\" data-media-id=\"ef4a137e-5a14-4634-9af8-64d1a046b838\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448268364702&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1328&amp;height=764 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448268364702&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=402 1x\" /></span><strong data-colorid=\"y7siywuzyw\" style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Setting up BMI Concept in OpenMRS</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI%20Status.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448268632890&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=399\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/33456359/BMI%20Status.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448268632890&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013230\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"BMI Status.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"33456359\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"22\" data-media-id=\"783294f6-e317-44ed-b21a-08c9ec13d333\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI%20Status.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448268632890&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1259&amp;height=719 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/33456359/BMI%20Status.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448268632890&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=399 1x\" /></span><strong data-colorid=\"kh55jtaove\" style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Setting up BMI Status Concept in OpenMRS</span></strong></span></p><p>3) Configure Calculated Concepts as concept names in the dashboard.json config. Refer to the code snippet below:</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7be83cc7-881c-4ea3-8cdc-5d3edc71cc6e\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&nbsp;&quot;nutritionalValues&quot;: {\n                &quot;title&quot;:&quot;Nutritional Values&quot;,\n                &quot;translationKey&quot;:&quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_NUTRITIONAL_VALUES_KEY&quot;,\n                &quot;name&quot;: &quot;vitals&quot;,\n                &quot;isObservation&quot;: true,\n                &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 11,\n                &quot;dashboardParams&quot;: {\n                    &quot;conceptNames&quot;: [\n                        &quot;HEIGHT&quot;,\n                        &quot;Weight&quot;,\n                        &quot;BMI&quot;,\n                        &quot;BMI STATUS&quot;\n                    ],\n                    &quot;numberOfVisits&quot;: 2\n                },</pre>\n</div></div><p>Refer to&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/dashboard.json\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/dashboard.json</a>&nbsp;for further information.</p><p>4) For auto-calculation of BMI, the latest instance of Height and Weight will be calculated from the <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Groovy+Scripts\" rel=\"nofollow\">groovy script</a> and validated by referencing them with the BMI_chart. For further information refer to&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bhamni/default-config/tree/master/openmrs/obscalculator\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/tree/master/openmrs/obscalculator</a>.</p><p>Here are sample groovy script and BMI charts:&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/download/attachments/33456359/BMI_chart.csv?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1448271083482&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013240\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"BMI_chart.csv\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"text/csv\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"33456359\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"22\">BMI_chart.csv</a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/obscalculator/BahmniObsValueCalculator.groovy\" rel=\"nofollow\">BahmniObsValueCalculator.groovy</a></p><p><br /></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"8744b669-fc34-46c9-9f64-994846d436ab\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>See this discussion and video also (how to auto-calculate fields in Forms): <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://talk.openmrs.org/t/auto-calculate-using-implementers-interface/15783\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://talk.openmrs.org/t/auto-calculate-using-implementers-interface/15783</a></p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e7b3588e-96e1-4de3-a29d-46427cf35a1e\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"1af9eacb-d839-4324-bf36-f73323196f05\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/40501363/Capturing+Observations\" data-linked-resource-id=\"40501363\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Observations Form - Feature Guide</a></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Groovy+Scripts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Groovy Scripts</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
